e Game", "keywords": ["blockpuzzle", "blockgame", "puzzlegame", "blockblast", "blockbuilder"], "long_description": "Welcome to Block Blitz VR: Block Puzzle Game, an immersive virtual reality puzzle experience designed for players who enjoy strategic thinking, relaxing gameplay, and endless challenges.\n\nEnter a vibrant VR world where your goal is simple: place blocks wisely, complete lines, and keep the board clear for as long as possible. Easy to learn and satisfying to master, Block Blitz VR delivers the classic fun of a block puzzle while taking advantage of the immersive possibilities of virtual reality.\n\nWhether you are looking for a casual block game to enjoy during short sessions or a puzzle game that rewards careful planning and strategy, Block Blitz VR offers a balanced experience suitable for players of all skill levels. Every placement matters, encouraging thoughtful decisions and creative solutions as the challenge gradually increases.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Immersive VR gameplay designed for comfort and accessibility\n\u2022 Classic block puzzle mechanics with intuitive controls\n\u2022 Endless gameplay for high-score chasing and skill improvement\n\u2022 Relaxing and enjoyable experience for all ages\n\u2022 Strategic challenges that test logic and planning\n\u2022 Smooth performance optimized for VR devices\n\u2022 Simple to learn, rewarding to master\n\nBuild your strategy, improve your score, and enjoy a satisfying puzzle adventure whenever you play. Fans of classic block puzzles, brain-training games, and creative block builder experiences will find plenty to enjoy.\n\nChallenge yourself & sharpen your thinking skills.", "short_description": "Step into Block Blitz VR: Block Puzzle Game and enjoy a fun, immersive puzzle experience. Place blocks strategically, clear lines, and challenge your skills in a relaxing virtual environment. This blockpuzzle adventure combines classic gameplay with VR immersion, making every move exciting. Whether you enjoy a blockgame for casual fun or a puzzlegame that tests your strategy, Block Blitz VR offers endless entertainment and rewarding challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Engineers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1132092336659321"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_3311134729048667_8718841674057006469_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mLGhC9TwuYUQ7kNvwGdjzWk&_nc_oc=AdqLTQ7w3e4c17GwBozdJVKkSFAzDxNPpAxtmyRmUvT_oE_ZT1kbE2uumjPRMOvZ5Do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMiiMvHTsCSPRSAgovFqW1B_Fde0CrETJvhhFji13zuFg&oe=6AC3C549"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Block Blitz VR: Block Puzzle Game", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "377978390272490"}], "release_date": 1782312480, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1132092353325986", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_s